The wrapper sets OPENAI_BASE_URL to `<server>/v1`, and getNormalizedOpenAIBaseUrl
keeps the /v1, so `${baseUrl}/router/models` resolved to `.../v1/router/models`
— a 404 that silently fell back to the install-time env vars. Strip a trailing
/v1 first so the fetch hits the router root. Verified: `.../router/models` 200s
and yields the tp/pp metadata for all 18 models.
---
 src/utils/model/openaiModelDiscovery.ts | 5 ++++-
 1 file changed, 4 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/src/utils/model/openaiModelDiscovery.ts b/src/utils/model/openaiModelDiscovery.ts
